    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shadow Stalker is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror experience. One player takes on the role of <strong>\u201cThe Hunted,\u201d</strong> a near-invisible monstrosity armed with supernatural abilities, while 2\u20138 other players team up as <strong>\u201cThe Hunters,\u201d</strong> a well-equipped elite task force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...Over here...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The Hunted thrives in the shadows, barely perceptible to the naked eye. Despite the number of Hunters outnumbering The Hunted, The Hunted\u2019s unique powers can even the odds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Climbing</strong> \u2013 Scale walls, crawl along ceilings, and strike from impossible angles.<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the Dead</strong> \u2013 Reanimate defeated NPCs and players to create a shambling horde that slows your pursuers.<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt or Be Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Step into the boots of a Hunter\u2014a member of an elite squad tasked with bringing down The Hunted. Work as a team, keep your eyes peeled, and use advanced tactics to corner your prey. Armed with high-tech weapons and gadgets, you\u2019ll need to stay alert; or you might just find yourself on the receiving end of the hunt.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Shadow Stalker is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror experience. One player takes on the role of <strong>\u201cThe Hunted,\u201d</strong> a near-invisible monstrosity armed with supernatural abilities, while 2\u20138 other players team up as <strong>\u201cThe Hunters,\u201d</strong> a well-equipped elite task force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...Over here...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The Hunted thrives in the shadows, barely perceptible to the naked eye. Despite the number of Hunters outnumbering The Hunted, The Hunted\u2019s unique powers can even the odds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Climbing</strong> \u2013 Scale walls, crawl along ceilings, and strike from impossible angles.<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the Dead</strong> \u2013 Reanimate defeated NPCs and players to create a shambling horde that slows your pursuers.<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt or Be Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Step into the boots of a Hunter\u2014a member of an elite squad tasked with bringing down The Hunted. Work as a team, keep your eyes peeled, and use advanced tactics to corner your prey. Armed with high-tech weapons and gadgets, you\u2019ll need to stay alert; or you might just find yourself on the receiving end of the hunt.</p>",
